<Description>
<![CDATA[K5100 (2198-Exxxx-ERS) - Use the Motion Axis Jog (MAJ) instruction to move an axis at a constant speed until you tell it to stop.]]>
</Description>
<RevisionNote>
<![CDATA[September 2019, initial release.
November 2019, keep Sts_IP when Sts_PC is set]]>
</RevisionNote>
<AdditionalHelpText>
<![CDATA[============================================================
Instruction Overview:
-----
K5100 (2198-Exxxx-ERS) - Use the Motion Axis Jog (MAJ) instruction to move an axis at a constant speed until you tell it to stop.


Supplemental Descriptions:
-----
Sts_ERR codes:(Value - Description)
100 – Drive is not ready.
101 – Drive is faulted.
103 – MSF is running.
105 – Drive is not active.
107 – MAS is executing.
108 – Another motion AOI is sending the command.
111 – SpeedReference is out of range.
112 – AccelReference is out of range.
113 – DecelReference is out of range.
127 – Previous motion has not completed.
129 – Motor is not connected.


Revision Notes:
-----
1.1.01
- September 2019, initial release.


