<![CDATA[Message ID executes the message commands. The laser loooks for this word to change for the command to be processed.

NOTE: the message type and the data for that type needs to be filled in prior to changing the ID (executing) ]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(S18Control_SM.Control.Bit[1])[OTU(S18Control_SM.Control.Bit[1]) ,CPT(TelesisLaser_OUT.Data[3],(TelesisLaser_OUT.Data[3] + 1) MOD 10) ];]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="1" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Station 18 Control State Machine]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(S:FS)CLR(S18Control_SM.Control.StateReg);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="2" Type="N">
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(S18Control_SM.Status.State[0])XIC(MainAssemblyOK)MOV(2,S18Control_SM.Control.StateReg);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="3" Type="N">
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(Supervisor_SM.Status.State[4])MOV(2,S18Control_SM.Control.StateReg);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
