<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(Supervisor_SM.Status.State[5])XIC(S18Control_SM.Status.State[60])XIC(Indexer_SM.Status.State[9])XIO(StationStatus[18].S18Attempt)[XIC(StationStatus[18].S15Success) ,XIC(HMI_Data.StationStatus[18].ForceOn) ]MOV(4,S18Control_SM.Control.StateReg);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="6" Type="N">
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(Supervisor_SM.Status.State[5])[XIC(S18Control_SM.Status.State[4]) XIC(PartAtLaser) XIO(Laser_EDM1) XIO(Laser_EDM2) XIC(TelesisLaser_IN.Data[6].4) XIC(TelesisLaser_IN.Data[8].1) TON(S18Control_SM.Control.Timer[6],?,?) XIC(S18Control_SM.Control.Timer[6].DN) COP(EmptyString10,S18WorkingLaserData,1) MOV(Recipe.Running.LaserData,S18WorkingLaserData) ,XIC(S18Control_SM.Status.State[38]) TON(S18Control_SM.Control.Timer[7],?,?) XIC(S18Control_SM.Control.Timer[7].DN) ]MOV(25,S18Control_SM.Control.StateReg);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="7" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[STATE 25
Send Text Data To Laser (Pattern File Line 1)

MessageType "V" - Send Variable Data To Pattern File.

If the "Ready" signal is already on then a verification needs to be done after sending the data.
Without seeing the "Ready" signal transition from false to true OR the response transition from NACK to ACK
we can't know for sure the data got there.]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(Supervisor_SM.Status.State[5])XIC(S18Control_SM.Status.State[25])[[XIC(TelesisLaser_IN.Data[8].0) ,XIC(S18Control_SM.Control.Bit[2]) ] OTL(S18Control_SM.Control.Bit[3]) ,FLL(0,TelesisLaser_OUT.Data[4],40) COP(EmptyString10,S18ascDataTemp,1) ,MOV(ASCIIConstants.V,TelesisLaser_OUT.Data[4]) MOV(ASCIIConstants.Zero,TelesisLaser_OUT.Data[5]) MOV(ASCIIConstants.One,TelesisLaser_OUT.Data[6]) COP(S18WorkingLaserData,S18ascDataTemp,1) COP(S18ascDataTemp.DATA[0],TelesisLaser_OUT.Data[7],10) OTL(S18Control_SM.Control.Bit[1]) ,MOV(26,S18Control_SM.Control.StateReg) ];]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="8" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[STATE 26
Send Text data to laser.
Wait for ACK.

NOTE: Line 2 is also sent to for all pattern files. See note for STATE 35.
Do NOT add a state change here to skip sending Line 2.]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(Supervisor_SM.Status.State[5])XIC(S18Control_SM.Status.State[26])[TON(S18Control_SM.Control.Timer[2],?,?) ,EQU(TelesisLaser_OUT.Data[3],TelesisLaser_IN.Data[10]) EQU(TelesisLaser_IN.Data[12],ASCIIConstants.ACK) [XIC(S18Control_SM.Control.Bit[3]) [OTU(S18Control_SM.Control.Bit[3]) ,MOV(32,S18Control_SM.Control.StateReg) ] ,XIO(S18Control_SM.Control.Bit[3]) MOV(35,S18Control_SM.Control.StateReg) ] ];]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="9" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[STATE 32
Verify correct variable data is loaded.

 MessageType "V?" ##, no data, queries the step number (1 in this case) in the pattern file for its variable data.]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(Supervisor_SM.Status.State[5])XIC(S18Control_SM.Status.State[32])[FLL(0,TelesisLaser_OUT.Data[4],40) ,MOV(ASCIIConstants.V,TelesisLaser_OUT.Data[4]) MOV(ASCIIConstants.QuestionMark,TelesisLaser_OUT.Data[5]) MOV(ASCIIConstants.Zero,TelesisLaser_OUT.Data[6]) MOV(ASCIIConstants.One,TelesisLaser_OUT.Data[7]) OTL(S18Control_SM.Control.Bit[1]) ,MOV(33,S18Control_SM.Control.StateReg) ];]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="10" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[STATE 33
Verify variable data.
Wait for ACK.]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(Supervisor_SM.Status.State[5])XIC(S18Control_SM.Status.State[33])[TON(S18Control_SM.Control.Timer[3],?,?) ,EQU(TelesisLaser_OUT.Data[3],TelesisLaser_IN.Data[10]) EQU(TelesisLaser_IN.Data[12],ASCIIConstants.ACK) MOV(34,S18Control_SM.Control.StateReg) ];]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="11" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[STATE 34
Compare retrieved variable data.]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(Supervisor_SM.Status.State[5])XIC(S18Control_SM.Status.State[34])COP(TelesisLaser_IN.Data[13],S18VariableDataResponse.DATA[0],10)MOV(10,S18VariableDataResponse.LEN)MOV(10,S18CurrentTextData.LEN)COP(S18WorkingLaserData.DATA[0],S18CurrentTextData.DATA[0],10)EQU(S18CurrentTextData,S18VariableDataResponse)MOV(35,S18Control_SM.Control.StateReg);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="12" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[STATE 35
Trigger Laser Etch]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(Supervisor_SM.Status.State[5])XIC(S18Control_SM.Status.State[35])[TON(S18Control_SM.Control.Timer[4],?,?) ,XIO(TelesisLaser_IN.Data[8].1) MOV(36,S18Control_SM.Control.StateReg) RES(S18Control_SM.Control.Counter[0]) ,XIC(S18Control_SM.Control.Timer[4].DN) XIO(S18Control_SM.Control.Counter[0].DN) MOV(38,S18Control_SM.Control.StateReg) CTU(S18Control_SM.Control.Counter[0],?,?) ];]]>
