<![CDATA[XIC(Supervisor_SM.Status.State[5])XIC(BoxShift_SM.Status.State[14])XIC(r05Packaging_IN.Input[7].4)XIO(r05Packaging_IN.Input[7].3)XIC(r05Packaging_IN.Input[7].2)MOV(16,BoxShift_SM.Control.StateReg);]]>
