<Rung Number="15" Type="N">
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(Supervisor_SM.Status.State[5])XIC(MachineRunning)XIC(BoxShift_SM.Status.Faulted)MOV(63,BoxShift_SM.Control.StateReg);]]>
